{"page":192,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:32","surah":9,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"يُرِيدُونَ أَن يُطْفِـُٔوا۟ نُورَ ٱللَّهِ بِأَفْوَٰهِهِمْ وَيَأْبَى ٱللَّهُ إِلَّآ أَن يُتِمَّ نُورَهُۥ وَلَوْ كَرِهَ ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They try to extinguish God’s light with their mouths, but God insists on bringing His light to its fullness, even if the disbelievers hate it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يُرِيدُونَ","en_gloss":"They want","transliteration":"yurīdūna","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُطْفِـُٔوا۟","en_gloss":"extinguish","transliteration":"yuṭ'fiū","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نُورَ","en_gloss":"Allah's light","transliteration":"nūra","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah's light","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِأَفْوَٰهِهِمْ","en_gloss":"with their mouths","transliteration":"bi-afwāhihim","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَيَأْبَى","en_gloss":"but Allah refuses","transliteration":"wayabā","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"but Allah refuses","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُتِمَّ","en_gloss":"perfect","transliteration":"yutimma","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نُورَهُۥ","en_gloss":"His Light","transliteration":"nūrahu","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"even if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَرِهَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers dislike (it)","transliteration":"kariha","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers dislike (it)","transliteration":"l-kāfirūna","verse_key":"9:32"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:32"}]},{"verse_key":"9:33","surah":9,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَرْسَلَ رَسُولَهُۥ بِٱلْهُدَىٰ وَدِينِ ٱلْحَقِّ لِيُظْهِرَهُۥ عَلَى ٱلدِّينِ كُلِّهِۦ وَلَوْ كَرِهَ ٱلْمُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who has sent His Messenger with guidance and the religion of truth, to show that it is above all [other] religions, however much the idolaters may hate this.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَرْسَلَ","en_gloss":"has sent","transliteration":"arsala","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَسُولَهُۥ","en_gloss":"His Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlahu","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْهُدَىٰ","en_gloss":"with the guidance","transliteration":"bil-hudā","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَدِينِ","en_gloss":"and the religion","transliteration":"wadīni","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"(of) [the] truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِيُظْهِرَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to manifest it","transliteration":"liyuẓ'hirahu","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلدِّينِ","en_gloss":"all religions","transliteration":"l-dīni","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُلِّهِۦ","en_gloss":"all religions","transliteration":"kullihi","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"Even if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَرِهَ","en_gloss":"dislike (it)","transliteration":"kariha","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكُونَ","en_gloss":"the polytheists","transliteration":"l-mush'rikūna","verse_key":"9:33"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:33"}]},{"verse_key":"9:34","surah":9,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِنَّ كَثِيرًا مِّنَ ٱلْأَحْبَارِ وَٱلرُّهْبَانِ لَيَأْكُلُونَ أَمْوَٰلَ ٱلنَّاسِ بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ وَيَصُدُّونَ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَٱلَّذِينَ يَكْنِزُونَ ٱلذَّهَبَ وَٱلْفِضَّةَ وَلَا يُنفِقُونَهَا فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ فَبَشِّرْهُم بِعَذَابٍ أَلِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, many rabbis and monks wrongfully consume people’s possessions and turn people away from God’s path. [Prophet], tell those who hoard gold and silver instead of giving in God’s cause that they will have a grievous punishment:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَثِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"many","transliteration":"kathīran","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَحْبَارِ","en_gloss":"the rabbis","transliteration":"l-aḥbāri","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلرُّهْبَانِ","en_gloss":"and the monks","transliteration":"wal-ruh'bāni","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَيَأْكُلُونَ","en_gloss":"surely eat","transliteration":"layakulūna","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَمْوَٰلَ","en_gloss":"(the) wealth","transliteration":"amwāla","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"(of) the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ","en_gloss":"in falsehood","transliteration":"bil-bāṭili","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَيَصُدُّونَ","en_gloss":"and hinder","transliteration":"wayaṣuddūna","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":15,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يَكْنِزُونَ","en_gloss":"hoard","transliteration":"yaknizūna","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلذَّهَبَ","en_gloss":"the gold","transliteration":"l-dhahaba","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَٱلْفِضَّةَ","en_gloss":"and the silver","transliteration":"wal-fiḍata","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":22,"ar":"يُنفِقُونَهَا","en_gloss":"spend it","transliteration":"yunfiqūnahā","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":24,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":26,"ar":"فَبَشِّرْهُم","en_gloss":"[so] give them tidings","transliteration":"fabashir'hum","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":27,"ar":"بِعَذَابٍ","en_gloss":"of a punishment","transliteration":"biʿadhābin","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":28,"ar":"أَلِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīmin","verse_key":"9:34"},{"pos":29,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:34"}]},{"verse_key":"9:35","surah":9,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ يُحْمَىٰ عَلَيْهَا فِى نَارِ جَهَنَّمَ فَتُكْوَىٰ بِهَا جِبَاهُهُمْ وَجُنُوبُهُمْ وَظُهُورُهُمْ ۖ هَـٰذَا مَا كَنَزْتُمْ لِأَنفُسِكُمْ فَذُوقُوا۟ مَا كُنتُمْ تَكْنِزُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"on the Day it is heated up in Hell’s Fire and used to brand their foreheads, sides, and backs, they will be told, ‘This is what you hoarded up for yourselves! Now feel the pain of what you hoarded!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(The) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"9:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُحْمَىٰ","en_gloss":"it will be heated [on it]","transliteration":"yuḥ'mā","verse_key":"9:35"},{"pos"